{"id": "abag-rincon-hill-bond-embezzlement", "title": "A false developer reimbursement diverted $1.3 million in Rincon Hill bond funds", "seconds": 72.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.087, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "f1678e0e3314c9fd", "words": 191, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Rincon Hill bond money was set aside for neighborhood improvements.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.6, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "received", "the", "developer", "payment?"], "sub": "A change to the trust agreement removed City approval", "source": "bond"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 0.9, 1.24, 1.52, 1.67, 1.85, 2.16, 2.31, 2.73]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The trust agreement originally required City approval to withdraw the money.", "t0": 3.72, "t1": 8.04, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "transfer", "layout": "table", "heading": "City approval", "context": "Original bond terms and July 2014 amendment", "rows": [{"label": "Original indenture", "value": "City sign-off required"}, {"label": "Amendment", "value": "City sign-off removed"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.45, 0.85, 1.41, 2.0, 2.29, 3.21, 3.37, 3.86, 3.99]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In July 2014 the financing authority removed that requirement without the City’s knowledge.", "t0": 8.16, "t1": 13.82, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "transfer", "layout": "table", "heading": "City approval", "context": "Original bond terms and July 2014 amendment", "rows": [{"label": "Original indenture", "value": "City sign-off required"}, {"label": "Amendment", "value": "City sign-off removed"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.54, 0.85, 1.69, 1.84, 2.32, 2.72, 3.22, 3.4, 4.27, 4.66, 4.79, 5.17]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Clarke Howatt, the finance director, made a request in the developer’s name.", "t0": 14.04, "t1": 18.45, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "plea", "kicker": "The developer reimbursement reached the finance director’s account", "text": "The reimbursement request", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 1.04, 1.18, 1.61, 2.51, 2.69, 2.77, 3.33, 3.44, 3.54, 4.05]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "More than a million dollars went to a company account he controlled.", "t0": 18.57, "t1": 21.65, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "transfer", "layout": "table", "heading": "A $1,296,340.66 transfer", "context": "Rincon Hill, August 2014", "rows": [{"label": "Request", "value": "Developer reimbursement"}, {"label": "Receiving account", "value": "Controlled by Howatt"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.42, 0.49, 0.83, 1.26, 1.45, 1.58, 1.66, 2.02, 2.4, 2.52]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City authorized repayment of the principal, plus interest and up to $30,000 in costs.", "t0": 21.77, "t1": 28.63, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "terms", "kicker": "The City approved a settlement and reserved infrastructure funds", "text": "Up to $30,000 for City costs", "mark": "Up"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.47, 1.08, 1.56, 1.64, 1.75, 2.75, 3.15, 3.94, 4.27, 4.43, 4.59, 4.96, 5.41, 6.07, 6.28]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In San Ramon, he also obtained surplus bond money after the public improvements were finished.", "t0": 28.75, "t1": 35.59, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "plea", "kicker": "The guilty plea and sentence covered two districts", "text": "A second district", "mark": "A"}, "wt": [0.0, 1.43, 1.73, 2.67, 2.83, 3.19, 3.6, 4.1, 4.42, 4.83, 5.25, 5.37, 5.74, 6.24, 6.4]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "He pleaded guilty to wire fraud. The Rincon Hill transfer was part of his federal total.", "t0": 35.71, "t1": 41.24, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "plea", "layout": "table", "heading": "One federal total", "context": "Rincon Hill is already included", "rows": [{"label": "Rincon Hill wire", "value": "$1,296,340.66"}, {"label": "Total admitted", "value": "$3,876,135.21"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.67, 1.15, 1.31, 1.68, 2.6, 2.77, 3.29, 3.57, 4.08, 4.28, 4.53, 4.62, 4.76, 5.14]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A federal judge sentenced him to one year and one day in prison.", "t0": 41.36, "t1": 44.79, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "sentence", "layout": "table", "heading": "Federal sentence", "context": "March 23, 2016", "rows": [{"label": "Prison", "value": "One year and one day"}, {"label": "Supervised release", "value": "Three years"}, {"label": "Home confinement", "value": "Six months of supervision"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.56, 0.92, 1.34, 1.51, 1.67, 1.91, 2.22, 2.37, 2.62, 2.86, 2.99]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Across the scheme, about $3.5 million came back from his assets and resources.", "t0": 45.01, "t1": 51.0, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "recovery", "layout": "table", "heading": "Recovery across affected accounts", "context": "FY2015 financial statements", "rows": [{"label": "Employee assets and resources", "value": "About $3.5 million"}, {"label": "Insurer remittance", "value": "$400,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 1.2, 1.31, 1.73, 2.03, 2.34, 2.63, 2.96, 3.35, 4.04, 4.31, 4.56, 4.72, 4.88, 5.22, 5.35]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The insurer paid another $400,000.", "t0": 51.12, "t1": 53.73, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "recovery", "layout": "table", "heading": "Recovery across affected accounts", "context": "FY2015 financial statements", "rows": [{"label": "Employee assets and resources", "value": "About $3.5 million"}, {"label": "Insurer remittance", "value": "$400,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.7, 0.94, 1.25, 1.46, 1.73, 2.1]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The authority later moved accounting duties and added independent checks on disbursements.", "t0": 53.85, "t1": 58.65, "shot": "s13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "controls", "kicker": "Restitution, a City receipt and new safeguards", "text": "Controls after the theft", "mark": "Controls"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.63, 0.93, 1.21, 1.66, 2.22, 2.54, 2.83, 3.44, 3.88, 4.04]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "San Francisco’s Controller tracked the infrastructure share to the trustee in July 2016.", "t0": 58.77, "t1": 64.5, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "receipt", "layout": "table", "heading": "Infrastructure funds", "context": "San Francisco Controller, table A2.1", "rows": [{"label": "Settlement share received", "value": "$925,666"}, {"label": "Trustee", "value": "Union Bank"}, {"label": "Receipt", "value": "July 2016"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.96, 1.52, 1.85, 1.96, 2.68, 3.03, 3.15, 3.26, 4.12, 4.34, 4.7, 5.02]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The final ledger would show the interest and City costs actually paid.", "t0": 64.62, "t1": 68.7, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "terms", "kicker": "Restitution, a City receipt and new safeguards", "text": "What the final ledger would show", "mark": "What"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 0.79, 1.01, 1.31, 1.46, 1.87, 2.04, 2.43, 3.06, 3.65]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 68.82, "t1": 71.26, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.85, 1.02, 1.3, 1.37, 1.47, 1.71, 1.99]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A change to the trust agreement removed City approval", "b": "The developer reimbursement reached the finance director’s account", "o": "Restitution, a City receipt and new safeguards"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "question"}